        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin 6504.009 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Door Adaptor</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Baldwin Pre-Drilled Door Adaptor is for used on 2-1/8\" pre-bored doors. Works with full dummy, passage and privacy functions. Must use 2-5/8\" diameter or larger rosette or escutcheon to cover this Baldwin Pre Drilled Door Adaptor. Not for use with keyed entry knobs or keyed entry levers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Choose Adaptor Type</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>6504.009 Spring Assisted Adaptor for Levers:</b> for use with  <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-estates-door-lever-sets\"><b>Baldwin Estates Levers</b></a>. We recommend you use the 6504.009 adaptor on heavier levers when using a lever strength latch.</li>\r\n\r\n<li><b>6503.009 Standard Adaptor:</b> for use with <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-estates-door-knob-sets\"><b>Baldwin Estates Knobs</b></a> and lighter Estates levers. Works with both knob & lever strength latches.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
